{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1120313001:1":{"text":"奇怪？这孩子最近有得罪过什么人吗？或者是有什么仇家之类的？","source_cn":"奇怪？这孩子最近有得罪过什么人吗？或者是有什么仇家之类的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFFDD2BE2E62557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120313002:1":{"text":"没有……吧？在我们乌尔氏族，大家相处的都挺好的……","source_cn":"没有……吧？在我们乌尔氏族，大家相处的都挺好的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585508D4325653E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120313003:1":{"text":"嗯……那她这几天有没有吃什么乱七八糟的东西？","source_cn":"嗯……那她这几天有没有吃什么乱七八糟的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FDBF94A709A598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120313004:1":{"text":"这个……我不太确定。你知道的，小孩子经常容易把奇怪的东西放进嘴里……","source_cn":"这个……我不太确定。你知道的，小孩子经常容易把奇怪的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0BE5E0A6778EDB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120313005:1":{"text":"啊呀，说的也是，蒙蒙他们要是肚子饿了，什么都能往嘴里塞。我要是拦了，他们还特别不高兴……","source_cn":"啊呀，说的也是，蒙蒙他们要是肚子饿了，什么都能往嘴里塞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA3B179D1636EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120313006:1":{"text":"咳，不好意思！总之根据我的经验来看，这孩子的症状应该都是由中毒引起的。","source_cn":"咳，不好意思！总之根据我的经验来看，这孩子的症状应该都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x379E297EBEB168FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120313007:1":{"text":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120313007":{"text":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120313008:1":{"text":"看着不像，毕竟乌尔氏族远离其他氏族，应该不会是有人蓄意投毒。","source_cn":"看着不像，毕竟乌尔氏族远离其他氏族，应该不会是有人蓄意投毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFBB7B59612ED1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120313010:1":{"text":"那、那我们该怎么办？找到她之前吃的东西吗？但是已经过去这么久了……","source_cn":"那、那我们该怎么办？找到她之前吃的东西吗？但是已经过去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA5E0407B64E5C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12